<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Performance Management & Scorecards</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Align individual brilliance with organizational strategy through a sophisticated 
            performance engine built on the proven Balanced Scorecard methodology.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Balanced Scorecard & KPI Alignment</h2>
        <p>
            Move performance management from an administrative burden to a strategic growth driver. 
            The system enables the cascading of organizational objectives from the board-level 
            Balanced Scorecard directly into individual employee KPIs. Every professional 
            within your organization can see exactly how their daily tasks contribute to 
            financial targets, customer satisfaction, internal process optimization, 
            and long-term learning and growth objectives.
        </p>
        <p>
            Dynamic scorecards visualize progress throughout the cycle, transforming 
            deadlines from a looming concern into a predictable, manageable 
            journey toward achievement.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">360-Degree Feedback & Stewardship</h2>
        <p>
            Foster a culture of professional honesty and growth through integrated 360-degree 
            feedback loops. Collect objective input from peers, subordinates, and 
            supervisors to build a rounded view of employee contribution and behavioral 
            competence. Annual and mid-year review cycles are managed through a structured 
            workflow, with every comment and rating permanently archived for long-term 
            stewardship.
        </p>
        <p>
            For individuals requiring additional support, the Performance Improvement Plan (PIP) 
            workflow provides a clear, documented structure for development, with 
            pre-defined milestones and review dates that ensure every employee has the 
            opportunity to reach their potential.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Strategic Talent Identification</h2>
        <p>
            Identify and nurture your future leadership. The Performance module analyzes rating 
            distributions across departments, highlighting high-potential (HiPo) employees ready 
            for succession planning. Correlating performance results with training and 
            qualification logs allows for the construction of specialized 
            development tracks, ensuring that the organization has a robust talent 
            pipeline to support its long-term growth and continuity.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated merit increment suggestions—based on achieved performance ratings 
            and budgeted departmental caps—provide a fair, data-driven foundation 
            for salary adjustments, fostering organizational transparency and morale.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

